Chromium
--------

The per-platform lists of font families for each CSS generic family and
script bucket (`src/platform/*/generics.rs`) record the default font
settings in Chromium's `chrome/app/resources/locale_settings_*.grd`. The
Windows lists of fonts per script (`src/platform/windows/scripts.rs`) and
the Windows catch-all lists (`src/platform/windows/tail.rs`) record the
lists in Chromium's `third_party/blink/renderer/platform/fonts/win/`
sources. Chromium is distributed under this license:

